d to you about context, because they're already using AI in YouTube for example", "to detect certain words that are being said are not appropriate or whatever And because Artificial Intelligence doesn't understand context, it can flag a video, it can remove a video, it can strike your channel And that can be a huge issue I have a friend who has this payment system or whatever, and you had some artificial intelligence Flagging one payment and it shut down the whole payment processor! It's a huge issue, just because it incorrectly flagged one transaction This Artificial Intelligence now is being used more often So now it's replacing people Now it's going to replace a lot of people in the future, especially in the electronic spaces Now, when it does look at the future, what kind of future are we expecting?", "Now, imagine, you know we can enter our houses- imagine they put for each building or each house or the grocery store or the bank or any government institution, They just put this facial recognition thing that is based on AI, and they give you points as a citizen And if you are being a good citizen, you can enter these specific locations If you're not being a good citizen, you're not going to be able to Each house has one of these systems that locks your house, and then you can be locked in your house Because we can know this has already been used in the cars and Tesla and whatever you guys already know, can lock a person inside his car using Artificial Intelligence So we're approaching an age when we need to be very, very careful about the advancements of these things, because they're not designed by Muslims", "They're not designed by people who agree with you ideologically, which means That if this becomes something which has more and more control every day, It's only going to harm us as a community So we need to be prepared And towards the end of the video, I'm going to mention what we need to do Very basic things, but what we need to do So these are all things that we need to look out for, harmful things, negative things, etc That we need to be very, very, very careful about Does that mean we should not be using Artificial Intelligence?", "No! I'm not saying that There's many good usages that we can use Artificial Intelligence in For example, translation For example, writing articles For example, correcting grammatical mistakes in articles For example, data entry, coding All of these things are OK You can use, as a Muslim, you can benefit from Artificial Intelligence You can use it in titles of videos or whatever You can use all of these things, creating thumbnails All of these are great usages of AI So we're not anti-AI, and we shouldn't be anti-AI We should be using it and benefiting from it At the same time, understand where it can be used and where it cannot be used It's a tool, just like anything else and everything else Just think of AI like you're using Google You're not going to trust a random site that pops up, and you don't even know who wrote that website", "Just think of AI the same, because it relies on all of these different websites to collect information So always keep that in mind, that it is not a reliable thing for you to go ask medical advice from, Or for you to go ask religious advice from. The are very specialised fields These things, for now, need to focus on going and asking the people of knowledge And people of understanding, and not basing it on such AI models So what should we do as Muslims? What is the thing that we should be doing? The first thing we should be doing is this timeless rule in the Quran This timeless rule, which is miraculous, which shows you that the Quran is for every time, And for every people and for every culture That the Quran tells you (alHujurat49:6) If an unknown person, if an ignorant person, if a disobedient person comes to you with the news,", "You need to verify it, you need to search, you need to investigate That's what the Quran teaches you to do Now, this rule, we need to thoroughly apply as Muslims Because like I said today, whether the deception that is being is happening And increasing day in and day out, you need to be very aware You cannot just trust whatever you see online You need to research, verify, and investigate, and make sure that whatever you're seeing, Whatever you're hearing, is accurate, and it is coming from the source Because like I said, very soon, like.. they all talk about this island and list..", "If you guys know what I'm talking about, it ends with \"stein\", you know? That list, for example, if it comes out, people can just come and say later on: oh, this is AI! All of these videos are AI and all of this.. So deception is going to increase very, very, very highly So we need to be very, very thorough in our investigation and research When we see information online or things being said Secondly, what else do we need to do? We need to advance ourselves in the knowledge of what these technologies are, Its capacity, and developing OUR OWN You know, our issue with social media is that we're reliant on non-Muslim social media, And then we're restricted, and we're having all of these issues If we did our own social media, we didn't have this issue So now with AI, we need to do that.", "We need to have our own people that are designing AI that we're using as Muslims in a way that benefits us Because we can input our data, just like these people are inputting their data They believe their morality is superior, and that's why their AI is going to reflect that We can programme our own AI as well And we need to advance ourselves in preventative measures, ways that we can protect ourselves So perhaps advancing these AIs so we can detect videos which are AI from videos which are not AI Probably it is going to be very difficult, but that's something that we need to work on And try to do our best to advance ourselves in these types of fields, so we can protect ourselves as Muslims and use that as a shield Because like I said, once these things are being used by these governments", "that disagree with your morality, that want to control you, then what else can you do? You're going to be trapped If you don't have something to protect yourself, if you're not advanced, if you're not familiar And knowledgeable about these type of systems, times are going to be very, very difficult And we can see, you know, this advancement is probably leading us to some sort of a.. Death of technology completely, and we're coming back to the old days That's what it seems like it's going, because AI is replacing humans in, as I said, all of these fields So nobody knows how the future is going to be And what kind of influence that is going to be on human beings generally And keep in mind, do not be a lazy person Remember Prophet Muhammad, peace be upon him, he said that: \"Ignorance will widespread\" Even though the Prophet, peace be upon him, said that: \"Writing will widespread\"", "And you can see that now with AI People are so lazy, they don't read, they don't investigate, they don't research You ask a guy, did you do research? He says: yes, yes And he just went and asked AI in two minutes, and he thinks that's research. That's not research! Research is that you do it on your own You understand what is the primary source of materials, you ask the people of expertise, etc. And you make sure that you're collecting the right information Now people are becoming lazy and lazy every day And you as a Muslim cannot be like that You need to be aware, and understand that these things are limited They have their own good usages They have their negative and harmful aspects And you need to be in the middle as Muslims, use it as a tool In the things in which it can benefit you, and then become more knowledgeable,", "Advance yourself, and protect yourself from any harms possible Alright brothers and sisters, inshaAllah (if God wills it), Hopefully that is a beneficial reminder for all of us And the most important thing, like I said, as Allah says in the Quran (anNahl16:43) (Ask the people of knowledge if you do not know)",))
